# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47155
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Adapt It did not find your work folder at\n"
"   %s\n"
"This error will occur either \n"
"1. because your work folder is located on an external drive which is not "
"currently plugged in, or \n"
"2. because there is a typing error in the work folder path stored in the "
"file named CustomWorkFolderLocation, or \n"
"3. another application currently has the CustomWorkFolderLocation file "
"open. \n"
"You will have a chance to recover now."
msgstr ""
"Adapt It tidak menemukan map kerja Anda di\n"
"   %s\n"
"Error ini dapat terjadi gara-gara salah satu hal berikut:\n"
"1. map kerja Anda terletak di sebuah alat yang tidak disambung sekarang, "
"atau \n"
"2. ada salah ketik di nama map yang tersimpan di dalam arsip bernama "
"\"CustomWorkFolderLocation\", atau \n"
"3. ada program lain yang sedang membuka arsip "
"\"CustomWorkFolderLocation\". \n"
"Sekarang Anda akan diberi kesempatan untuk menyelamatkan hasil kerja Anda."

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47157
msgid "Failed to find the custom work folder"
msgstr "Tidak menemukan map kerja yang Anda buat"

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47166
msgid "1. Plug in the missing external drive, then click OK here."
msgstr "1. Sambungkan drive yang perlu, lalu klik \"OK\" di sini."

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47167
msgid ""
"2. Close the other application, or use a text editor to fix the path in the "
"file CustomWorkFolderLocation; then click OK here."
msgstr ""
"2. Tutup aplikasi lain itu, atau pakai program pengubah teks untuk "
"memperbaiki jalur di dalam arsip \"CustomWorkFolderLocation\"; lalu klik "
"\"OK\" di sini."

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47168
msgid ""
"3. Ignore the custom work folder location, use the default location instead. "
"(Then ask your administrator to help you.)"
msgstr ""
"3. Abaikan Lokasi Khusus Map Kerja, dan pakai lokasi biasa saja.  (Lalu "
"minta Administrator membantu Anda.)"

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47169
msgid ""
"4. Forget the custom work folder location. The command Custom Work Folder "
"Location will then run, use it to relocate the folder."
msgstr ""
"4. Lupakan Lokasi Khusus Map Kerja.  Sesudah itu, perintah \"Lokasi Khusus "
"Map Kerja\" akan dijalankan.  Pakai proses itu untuk menentukan tempat untuk "
"map itu."

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47170
msgid "Choose Recovery Action or Cancel (to abort)"
msgstr "Pilih Tindakan Pemulihan, atau Batalkan"

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47171
msgid ""
"Select from the list of recovery actions, then click OK. The Cancel button "
"will abort the application. \n"
"1. Plug in the required external drive now, then click OK. \n"
"2. Leave the dialog open, launch a text editor, open the "
"CustomWorkFolderLocation file in it, edit the path, save, then click OK "
"here. \n"
"3. Forget (but do not delete) the custom work folder location, use the "
"default location instead. \n"
"4. Same as option 3. but also show the Administrator menu (helpful if you "
"know what to do with it)."
msgstr ""
"Pilih salah satu dari daftar tindakan pemulihan, lalu klik \"OK\".  Kalau "
"klik \"Batal\", Adapt It akan dihentikan.\n"
"1. Sambungkan drive yang perlu sekarang, lalu klik \"OK\".\n"
"2. Biarkan kotak perintah tetap buka; pakai program pengubah teks untuk "
"memperbaiki jalur di dalam arsip \"CustomWorkFolderLocation\"; simpan; lalu "
"klik \"OK\" di sini.\n"
"3. Lupakan (tetapi tidak menghapus) Lokasi Khusus Map Kerja, dan pakai "
"lokasi biasa saja.\n"
"4. Sama dengan pilihan 3, tetapi juga menampilkan menu Administrator.  (Ini "
"berguna kalau Anda tahu cara memakainya.)"

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47185
msgid ""
"The path to the custom work folder did not find a directory with the "
"required name. Did you plug in the external drive containing the work folder "
"before clicking OK in the dialog? Aborting now. Make the custom work "
"folder's location accessible on your machine before you re-launch Adapt It."
msgstr ""
"Jalur yang ditentukan untuk map kerja khusus tidak menemukan map dengan nama "
"yang dicari.  Apakah Anda menyambung drive di mana map kerja disimpan, "
"sebelum Anda klik \"OK\" di kotak perintah?  Adapt It akan dihentikan "
"sekarang. Pastikan map kerja khusus bisa ditemukan di komputer Anda sebelum "
"menghidupkan Adapt It lagi."

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47186
msgid "Recovery By Plugging In The Missing External Drive Failed"
msgstr "Menyambung Drive Tidak Mengakibatkan Pemulihan Berhasil"

# Priority 1
#: Adapt_It.cpp:47218
msgid ""
